  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_altium_61",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "COMMON SOC LVCMOS IO INTERFACE GUIDELINES",
    "font_size": 0.5555843348528803,
    "position": {
      "x": -6.239639452963118,
      "y": -3.803615830915872
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "bottom_left",
    "color": "#0000ff"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_frame_line_altium_62_0",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "Verify cap loading of the SOC output (when any cap value > 22 pF (use case dependent, max value) is connected, customer needs to simulate), ",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670067667322837,
      "y": -8.177062461147948
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "top_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_frame_line_altium_62_1",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "slew rate of the input signal (LVCMOS input slew should be 1000 ns or less), IO compatibility and fail-safe operation between the SOC IOs and ",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670067667322837,
      "y": -8.404994495959386
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "top_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_frame_line_altium_62_2",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "attached devices.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670067667322837,
      "y": -8.632926530770824
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "top_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_altium_63",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "Most of the SOC IOs are not fail-safe. No input should be applied before supply ramps.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670068379610445,
      "y": -4.416183174471612
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "bottom_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_altium_64",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "SOC LVCOMOS IOs have slew rate requirements specified, applying a slow ramp input or connecting a cap at the input is not recommended.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670068379610445,
      "y": -4.986013261500207
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "bottom_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_altium_65",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "Connecting a cap load 50 pF or more at the output is not recommended. DNI cap or perform simulations based on the use case.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670068379610445,
      "y": -5.555843348528803
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "bottom_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_altium_66",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "SOC IO buffers are off during Reset. A pull is required near to the attached device being driven by the SOC IO that could float.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670068379610445,
      "y": -6.125673435557397
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "bottom_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_frame_line_altium_67_0",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "Any SOC IO that has a trace connected needs a parallel pull. When adding pull is not feasible, ensure the traces are routed away ",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670067667322837,
      "y": -6.467572200062163
    },
    "rotation": 0,
    "anchor": "top_left",
    "color": "#1f2937"
  },
  {
    "type": "schematic_text",
    "schematic_text_id": "schematic_text_frame_line_altium_67_1",
    "schematic_sheet_id": "schematic_sheet_altium",
    "text": "from noisy signals.",
    "font_size": 0.22793203481143806,
    "position": {
      "x": -10.670067667322837,
